            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">长效 ISP 代理</div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-4">$0.27<small class="text-sm text-slate-500 font-normal">/GB</small></div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4">融合数据中心速度和住宅 IP 纯净度</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">•</span>10GB $8 → 1000GB $350</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">•</span>HTTP/SOCKS5 协议</li>
